# SKILL.md — freqtrade-triage

## Triggers
- "每天 08:00 UTC"
- "手动触发 /loop triage"

## Actions

### 1. List strategies with mtime
```bash
ls -la /root/code/freqtrade/user_data/strategies/
```

### 2. Find recent backtests (last 7 days)
```bash
find /root/code/freqtrade/user_data/backtest_results/ -name '*.json' -mtime -7
```

### 3. Recent log errors
```bash
tail -50 /root/code/freqtrade/user_data/logs/freqtrade.log
```

### 4. Recent commits
```bash
git -C /root/code/freqtrade log --oneline -10
```

### 5. Check for API errors (451 / GEO / blocked)
```bash
grep -i "error\|451\|blocked\|GEO" /root/code/freqtrade/user_data/logs/freqtrade.log
```

## Rules

| Condition | Flag |
|-----------|------|
| 策略文件 > 7天未回测 | `needs-backtest` |
| 日志有 `ERROR` | `high-priority` |
| 日志有 `451` 或 `GEO` | `binance-blocked` |
| `config.json` 中 `dry_run` 不为 `true` | `live-mode-warning` |
| backtest `win_rate < 0.40` | `degraded` |
| backtest `drawdown > 0.20` | `high-risk` |

## Output

Append findings to `/root/code/freqtrade/freqtrade-loop/STATE.md` under sections:

```
## Strategy Triage — <timestamp UTC>
### needs-backtest
### high-priority
### binance-blocked
### live-mode-warning
### degraded
### high-risk
```
